  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 singleprofile RNA-only outperforms pca_n2000 in both accuracy and F1, but there is no evidence yet on whether multiprofile representation helps. This experiment tests whether using scvi_n200 with multiple profiles and a simple avgpool aggregation improves over the best singleprofile RNA baseline, clarifying the effect of profile setting/aggregation while keeping the stronger RNA encoder fixed. It is the best next use of budget because it exploits the current promising direction, avoids adding unnecessary complexity such as transformer aggregation or fusion, and reduces uncertainty about a central design choice before investing in more complex multimodal configurations."
}

